# What is on one machine only, what is secret, and what a command builds from the sources each time.

# Secrets and local values: wrangler dev reads .dev.vars, which charter makes from .dev.vars.example.
.dev.vars
.env
.env.*

# Built from the sources by charter dev, build and check: gsx's components as Go (as gsx's own scaffold has it), the
# messages as Go, Vite's and the Worker's output, wrangler's local state, charter's own files.
*.x.go
*.built.go
/dist/
/build/
/.wrangler/
/.charter/

# The SDKs before one is published (sdk/go is committed), and translators' files.
/sdk/out/
/xliff/

.DS_Store
.playwright-mcp/
